# Generated files — formatting them makes every regeneration look like a huge
# diff and buries real changes. The generator owns their layout, not Prettier.
#
# Without this file the repo oscillates: `pnpm build` writes the generator's
# format, `pnpm format` rewrites it, and the next build flips it back. A token
# change of three lines shows up as ten thousand.

# pnpm writes `resolution: {integrity: …}` on one line; Prettier explodes it
# into four, tripling the file.
pnpm-lock.yaml

